{"turn_id": "d03-t2", "session_id": "d03", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "fever_scale", "text": "论文指出 FEVER 是最大的数据集，包含约 185k 条 claim，来自 5.4M 篇 Wikipedia 文章的语料。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}]}, {"key": "fever_labels", "text": "这些 claim 根据证据集被标注为“SUPPORTS”、“REFUTES”或“NOT ENOUGH INFO”。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-ab6380532554bfd8cf2dc78b"}]}, {"key": "fever_cloze_conversion", "text": "论文通过掩码 claim 中提供的命名实体，将 FEVER 数据集转换为 Cloze-task。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-7c69a28e7ffcb9ebd09842b6"}]}, {"key": "conversion_accuracy", "text": "Question Generation 任务在将 FEVER 数据集转换为 Cloze-task 时达到接近 90% 的准确率。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-7d59a4589df766fa1261d8c6"}]}, {"key": "questions_per_claim", "text": "论文报告平均每条 claim 生成 3 个问题。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-41beb2396050f5a800883bfc"}]}, {"key": "label_accuracy", "text": "该方法在转换后数据集的开发集上达到 80.2% 的标签准确率，在测试集上达到 80.25%。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-7c69a28e7ffcb9ebd09842b6"}]}, {"key": "classifier_scope", "text": "当前分类器只能将 claim 分类为“SUPPORTS”和“MANUAL_REVIEW”。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-7c69a28e7ffcb9ebd09842b6"}]}, {"key": "manual_review_rationale", "text": "由于 claim 验证和问题生成过程都不要求显式推理，难以赋予“REFUTES”或“NOT ENOUGH INFO”标签，因此论文将不支持的 claim 分类为“MANUAL_REVIEW”。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-c1927faa43ced5496949efab"}]}, {"key": "passage_unavailable", "text": "论文指出，已有的部分问题生成模型需要 passage 来生成合理问题，而 FEVER 数据集中并不直接提供 passage。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1910.07154", "chunk_id": "c-c1927faa43ced5496949efab"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d03-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed"